# ── Streamlit deployment ──────────────────────────────────────
# Model artifacts MUST be committed to Git for Streamlit Cloud.
# The lines below FORCE Git to track .pkl files inside model_artifacts/
# even if any parent rule might exclude them.
!model_artifacts/
!model_artifacts/*.pkl
